---
// src/components/CierreHumano.astro
// Tarjeta de Cierre Humanizada con Avatar y Disponibilidad en Vivo (Inspiración 20s Agencia)
---

<section class="py-14 px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
  <div class="spotlight-card rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0C0F1A] via-[#090B14] to-[#07090E] border border-cyan-500/20">
    <!-- Glow ambiental -->
    <div class="absolute -right-20 -bottom-20 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8 relative z-10">
      <!-- Mensaje Central con Asterisco de Firma -->
      <div class="space-y-3 text-center md:text-left max-w-xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-mono">
          <span>✦</span>
          <span>Filosofía de Arquitectura</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-snug">
          Pensamos, modelamos y validamos cada arquitectura antes de programarla:
          <span class="text-cyan-300"> software de alto rendimiento y cero deuda técnica.</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          Sin intermediarios ni presupuestos opacos. Conversarás directamente con el arquitecto que diseñará e implementará tu solución.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Tarjeta CTA con Avatar Personal Activo -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4 bg-white/[0.04] p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] shadow-xl shrink-0">
        <!-- Avatar con indicador Online -->
        <div class="relative">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?w=120&h=120&fit=crop&crop=faces"
            alt="Sebastian - Arquitecto de Software"
            class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-cyan-400 shadow-md shadow-cyan-400/20"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <span class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 border-2 border-[#0C0F1A] shadow-sm">
            <span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-ping opacity-75"></span>
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Textos y Botón -->
        <div class="text-center sm:text-left">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider font-headings">
            Sebastian
          </div>
          <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-1">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
            <span>Disponible hoy</span>
          </div>

          <a
            href="https://wa.me/573000000000?text=Hola%20Sebastian,%20quiero%20conversar%20sobre%20la%20arquitectura%20y%20desarrollo%20de%20un%20proyecto"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn-tactile mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-cyan-400 text-slate-950 font-bold text-xs tracking-wide hover:bg-cyan-300 shadow-md shadow-cyan-400/20"
          >
            <span>¡Hablemos de tu proyecto!</span>
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
